    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>'potential' and 'healing'... that sounds so hollow. it's hard to believe in any of that when the very thing that made me feel alive is dead. it feels less like a phase and more like a permanent state. like i've reached the end of my purpose and there's just nothing following it. i'm just... done. i feel like a finished book that's been left in the rain to rot.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
